#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kblocks; is the classic falling blocks game. The idea is stack the falling "
"blocks in a way that lines are completely filled. When a line is completed "
"it is removed, and more space is available in the play area. When there is "
"not enough space for blocks to fall, the game is over."
msgstr ""
"&kblocks; je klasična igra padajućih blokova. Ideja je složiti padajuće "
"blokove na način da se u potpunosti popune linije. Kada je linija potpuna, "
"otkanja se, i više prostora je dostupno za igru. Kada nema dovoljno mjesta "
"za blokove koji padaju, igrica se završava."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to Play"
msgstr "Uputstva za igranje"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "Objective:"
msgstr "Cilj:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Rotate the falling blocks, and fit them together to complete lines and clear "
"the playfield."
msgstr ""
"Rotiraj padajuće blokove, smjesti ih zajedno da upotpune linije i očisti "
"igralište."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default, falling blocks can be moved left or right using the "
"<keycap>Left</keycap> or <keycap>Right</keycap> arrow keys. The "
"<keycap>Down</keycap> arrow key makes the block drop faster, and the "
"<keycap>Up</keycap> key is used to rotate the block. The keys used for each "
"game action can be configured in <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Shortcuts...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Po defaultu, padajući blokovi mogu se pomjerati lijevo ili desno koristeći "
"<keycap>Left</keycap> ili <keycap>Right</keycap>  tipki sa strelicama.  The "
"<keycap> Down </keycap> strelice ubrzavaju padanje bloka, a <keycap> Up </"
"keycap> tipka se koristi za rotiranje bloka. Tipke koje se koriste za svaku "
"akciju u igri mogu se konfigurisati u <menuchoice> <guimenu> Postavke </"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem> Podesite kratice ... </guimenuitem> </menuchoice>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules, Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Pravila igre, Strategije i savjeti"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "Pravila"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "The rules are simple: just keep space for the blocks to fall!"
msgstr "Pravila su jednostavna: držite tipku space da bi blokovi padali!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "When a new block cannot fall, the game is over."
msgstr "Kada novi blok ne može pasti, igra je gotova."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Strategije i savjeti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Do not forget to check the preview area: it shows the next piece that will "
"be released."
msgstr ""
"Ne zaboravite provjeriti prostor za pregled sadržaja: pokazuje naredni oblik "
"koji će biti pušten."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "For additional points, try to remove several lines at once."
msgstr "Za dodatne bodove pokušajte ukloniti više linija odjednom."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "Commands/Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr "Commands/Keyboard Shortcuts"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "The following sections briefly describes each menubar option."
msgstr "Sljedeći odlomci ukratko opisuju svaku menubar opciju."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menu Items"
msgstr "Opcije menija"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Single Game</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Igra za jednog igrača</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starts a new single player game."
msgstr "Započinje novu igru za jednog igrača."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Human vs AI</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Čovjek vs AI</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Compare your skills with the AI and play against the computer using the same "
"sequence of falling blocks, where you have the first turn."
msgstr ""
"Uporedite svoje vještine sa AI-om i igrajte protiv računara koristeći isti "
"slijed pada blokova, gdje ste vi prvi na redu."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>P</keycap> </shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Pause</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>P</keycap> </shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Pauza</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pauses the game."
msgstr "Pauzira igru."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show High Scores</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Prikaži rekorde</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This shows you the high score (the maximum number of points) for each "
"difficulty level."
msgstr ""
"Ovo  vam pokazuje rekord (maksimalan broj bodova) za svaki nivo prepreka."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Odustati</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Quits</action> &kblocks;"
msgstr "<action>Quits</action> &kblocks;"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Difficulty</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Prepreke</guisubmenu>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lets you set the difficulty level from a sub-menu."
msgstr "Omogućava vam da podesite težinu nivoa iz podizbornika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are three default levels of difficulty: <guimenuitem>Easy</"
"guimenuitem> (game starts at level 0), <guimenuitem>Medium</guimenuitem> "
"(starts at level 5), and <guimenuitem>Hard</guimenuitem> (starts at level "
"10)."
msgstr ""
"Postoje tri podrazumijevana levela težine : <guimenuitem> Lagano </"
"guimenuitem> (igra počinje na nivou 0), <guimenuitem> Srednje </guimenuitem> "
"(počinje na nivou 5), i <guimenuitem> Teško </guimenuitem> (počinje na nivou "
"10)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &kblocks; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and "
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the sections "
"about the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Settings "
"Menu</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Pored toga &kblocks; ima zajedničke &kde; <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> i "
"<guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> stavke izbornika, za više informacija pročitajte "
"sekcije o <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Meni "
"postavki</ulink> i <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Meni "
"pomoći</ulink> za &kde; osnove."

