"trake menija."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "Često postavljana pitanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:217
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I change the way the game looks?"
msgstr "Mogu li promijeniti izgled igre?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes, click on the <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu and select "
"<guimenuitem>Configure &kblocks;...</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Da, kliknite na <guimenu> Postavke </guimenu> i odaberite <guimenuitem> "
"Konfiguracija i kblocks; ... </guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Settings"
msgstr "Postavke igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The game settings can be configured by selecting "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &kblocks;...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menubar. A dialog will appear."
msgstr ""
"Postavke igre se mogu konfigurisati odabirom <menuchoice> <guimenu> Postavke "
"</guimenu> <guimenuitem> Konfiguracija i kblocks; ... </guimenuitem> </"
"menuchoice> iz trake menija. Dijalog će se pojaviti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To select a new theme simply choose the theme from the selection list. Each "
"item in the list shows a small preview left to the theme name. A selection "
"is immediately applied."
msgstr ""
"Da biste izabrali novu temu jednostavno izabrati temu sa liste za izbor. "
"Svaka stavka na listi pokazuje mali pregled izabrane teme lijevo od imena "
"teme. Izbor se odmah primjenjuje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you are satisfied with the theme you have selected you can click the "
"<guibutton>Close</guibutton> button, located at the bottom part of this "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"Kada ste zadovoljni s temom ste izabrali možete kliknuti na <guibutton> "
"Zatvori </guibutton>, koji se nalazi na donjem dijelu ovog dijaloga."

